# Do NOT set VITE_API_ORIGIN=relative here.
#
# - Cloudflare unified deploy sets it only in scripts/deploy-cloudflare.mjs
#   (VITE_API_ORIGIN=relative) so SPA + /api share one origin.
# - Vercel builds set an absolute Worker URL in vercel.json buildCommand.
# - The SPA also runtime-guards *.vercel.app → Worker URL (see apiOrigin.ts).
#
# Leaving this unset avoids baking "relative" into a dist that might be
# uploaded to Vercel by mistake.
